    "overviewSummary": "Complete zero-trust authentication architecture implementing OAuth 2.1 and OpenID Connect with PKCE (Proof Key for Code Exchange) between a Single-Page App, an Authorization Server with HSM/KMS keys, and protected backend APIs.",
